    "enUS": {
      "description": "<The totem pulses with wild magic. The image of a ghostly wolf appears in your mind, beckoning you. \r\n\r\nIt appears to be offering you a challenge.\r\n\r\nAnother totem--a twin to the one that your hand now rests upon, appears in the distance just beyond the large sun-bleached skeleton nearby.>",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Reach Old Totem",
          "type": "event"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Reach the other Odd Totem at the end of the massive skeleton before time runs out.",
      "title": "Challenge of the Desert Wolf",
